.Dd February 11, 2026
.Dt VOP_FSYNC 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vop_fsync
.Nd flush dirty vnode data to backing storage
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In vfs/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn vop_fsync "struct vnode *vp" "int waitfor" "struct ucred *cred"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn vop_fsync
wrapper validates
.Fa waitfor
mode
.Po
.Dv MNT_WAIT
or
.Dv MNT_NOWAIT
.Pc ,
delegates flushing to the filesystem callback, and clears vnode modified state
when synchronization succeeds.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 0 on success, or an error number.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width "[EOPNOTSUPP]"
.It Bq Er EINVAL
Invalid wait mode.
.It Bq Er EIO
Backing I/O failed.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr vop_write 9 ,
.Xr vfs_sync 9
